<!-- A LightBurn project that CARRIES ITS OWN RENDER, which is what LightBurn 1.x actually
     writes. It is the RendererContractTest fixture because Lbrn2#available? is now
     unconditionally true (matching Mage): the contract test no longer skips this renderer on a
     box with no resvg, so its fixture has to be one that renders there. sample.lbrn2 is the
     opposite case on purpose and stays the fixture everywhere the OUTLINE path is under test. -->
